  "title": "Custom printed bakery bags",
  "category": "bakery-packaging",
  "status": "published",
  "short_description": "Your bread, wrapped in your name. Printed bread, baguette and pastry bags in kraft or white — the bag that leaves the counter with every sale.",
  "description": "Three bags cover the bakery counter: a large bread bag, a long greaseproof baguette bag and a small greaseproof pastry bag for cookies and pastries. Choose the bag, one or two print colours and the paper, then put your name on every sale.\n\nBoxing cakes and pastries too? See our [custom printed cake and pastry boxes](/bakery-packaging/pastry-boxes/). For handled carriers, see [custom printed paper bags](/paper-bags/printed-paper-bags/), and seal any bag with [logo stickers](/catering-supplies/logo-stickers/).\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "1 or 2 colour print",
    "Greaseproof options",
    "Your own artwork"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen item, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why are pastry bag quantities higher?",
      "a": "Pastry bags are produced in longer runs than bread and baguette bags, so their first price break is higher — the quantity options on this page show where it starts. If you need fewer, use “Request a custom quantity” and we will advise."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my bags arrive?",
      "a": "Standard bags are delivered 6–8 weeks from artwork approval. Express is 4 weeks from artwork approval on the sizes and quantities shown when you select it. We confirm timing with your written quote."
    }
  ],
